    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Project Management Task Sync\\n\\n**Platforms:**\\n- Trello\\n- Asana\\n- Jira\\n\\n**Features:**\\n- Bi-directional synchronization\\n- Conflict detection and resolution\\n- Change detection with hashing\\n- Automated notifications\\n- Sync state tracking\\n\\n**Conflict Resolution:**\\n- Strategy: Most recent wins\\n- Notifications sent to Slack\\n- Manual review option\\n\\n**Sync Frequency:**\\nEvery 5 minutes\\n\\n**Setup:**\\n- Trello API credentials\\n- Asana OAuth2\\n- Jira Cloud API\\n- PostgreSQL database\\n- Slack workspace",
        "height": 650,
        "width": 350
      },
